
# Node / Deno
node_modules/

# Dashboard bundle (rebuild: npm run build:dashboard)
js/dist/

# Raw/scraped data and the DuckDB base. Much of data/raw is NOT rebuildable
# (pollster PDFs whose press links die, the DGEQ results feed whose format is
# not guaranteed): what git can't carry is inventoried with SHA256 + origin in
# data/raw/MANIFEST.md and must be backed up off-machine. The small
# irreplaceable JSON inputs ARE tracked below.
/data/*
!/data/riding_names_2017.json
!/data/riding_names_2026.json
!/data/raw
/data/raw/*
!/data/raw/MANIFEST.md
!/data/raw/lus
/data/raw/lus/*
!/data/raw/lus/2026-10-05-resultats-dgeq.json

# NOTE: js/data/ is tracked on purpose. It mixes regenerable exports with
# ESTIMATED parameters (qc_systemic, qc_leader_effect, qc_regional_calibration,
# qc_riding_regions, the geojson) that no watch run can rebuild — some of their
# source data is no longer reachable. 2 MB total; keep it all.

# Outillage local (Claude, agents)
.claude/
.agents/
skills-lock.json

# Briefing de reprise local (non versionné)
AGENT.md
